# paperful.io

Do not mention **paperful.io** in user-facing copy, including “Not paperful.io” collision strips, hero footnotes, README asides, or FAQ rows that exist only to disclaim the other site.

This project is Paperful (`paperful.app`, this repo). Say what it is. Do not name the other domain.

Roadmap items that still list a “paperful.io strip” as a launch gate are stale; do not reintroduce that copy.
